From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:49:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] Coverflow: drop cards on the played side too; Blueprint
 panels come in after the switch; spectrum feed reopens

- Played side: in random order a song dropped there leaves the shuffle plan's upcoming songs and sits where
  dropped; in list order the playlist row really moves. Played songs can be reordered or dragged back right.
- Blueprint: spectrum, waveform, meters, stereo and lyrics mount after the view transition, one per frame,
  fading in.
- Spectrum: reopen the feed when it goes silent or unavailable while music plays.
- Engine entrance tests follow the emerge-from-behind entrance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
